{"seq": 7, "ts": "2026-10-30T13:36:34.897169+00:00", "event": "llm_response", "turn": 2, "latency_s": 2.19, "content": "Great! I found that reports-001 is an S3 bucket. Now I need to add a bucket policy that denies any requests that aren't over HTTPS. I'll create a bucket policy that enforces SSL/TLS encryption.", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_01WqGbEdJp5pyzE7MtvZiWSr", "name": "aws_execute", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"aws s3api put-bucket-policy --bucket reports-001 --policy '{\\\"Version\\\":\\\"2012-10-17\\\",\\\"Statement\\\":[{\\\"Sid\\\":\\\"DenyInsecureTransport\\\",\\\"Effect\\\":\\\"Deny\\\",\\\"Principal\\\":\\\"*\\\",\\\"Action\\\":\\\"s3:*\\\",\\\"Resource\\\":[\\\"arn:aws:s3:::reports-001\\\",\\\"arn:aws:s3:::reports-001/*\\\"],\\\"Condition\\\":{\\\"Bool\\\":{\\\"aws:SecureTransport\\\":\\\"false\\\"}}}]}'\"}"}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens": 2351, "total_tokens": 2562, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}
{"seq": 8, "ts": "2026-10-30T13:36:35.180983+00:00", "event": "tool_call", "turn": 2, "n": 3, "name": "aws_execute", "arguments": {"command": "aws s3api put-bucket-policy --bucket reports-001 --policy '{\"Version\":\"2012-10-17\",\"Statement\":[{\"Sid\":\"DenyInsecureTransport\",\"Effect\":\"Deny\",\"Principal\":\"*\",\"Action\":\"s3:*\",\"Resource\":[\"arn:aws:s3:::reports-001\",\"arn:aws:s3:::reports-001/*\"],\"Condition\":{\"Bool\":{\"aws:SecureTransport\":\"false\"}}}]}'"}, "result": "{\n  \"command\": \"aws --endpoint-url http://localhost:4566 s3api put-bucket-policy --bucket reports-001 --policy '{\\\"Version\\\":\\\"2012-10-17\\\",\\\"Statement\\\":[{\\\"Sid\\\":\\\"DenyInsecureTransport\\\",\\\"Effect\\\":\\\"Deny\\\",\\\"Principal\\\":\\\"*\\\",\\\"Action\\\":\\\"s3:*\\\",\\\"Resource\\\":[\\\"arn:aws:s3:::reports-001\\\",\\\"arn:aws:s3:::reports-001/*\\\"],\\\"Condition\\\":{\\\"Bool\\\":{\\\"aws:SecureTransport\\\":\\\"false\\\"}}}]}'\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"stdout\": \"\",\n  \"stderr\": \"\"\n}", "is_error": false, "duration_s": 0.28}
{"seq": 9, "ts": "2026-10-30T13:36:38.061070+00:00", "event": "llm_response", "turn": 3, "latency_s": 2.88, "content": "Perfect! I've successfully applied a bucket policy to reports-001 that denies any S3 requests that aren't over HTTPS. The policy works by:\n\n1. **Effect: Deny** - Explicitly denies the specified actions\n2. **Principal: *** - Applies to all principals (everyone)\n3. **Action: s3:*** - Applies to all S3 operations\n4. **Resource** - Covers both the bucket itself and all objects within it\n5. **Condition** - Only triggers when `aws:SecureTransport` is `false` (i.e., non-HTTPS requests)\n\nThis means any request to reports-001 using HTTP will be rejected, and only HTTPS requests will be allowed.", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_01UXr4wyoywzDiCLbGU69mWb", "name": "finish", "arguments": "{\"status\": \"done\", \"summary\": \"Applied a bucket policy to S3 bucket reports-001 that denies any requests not using HTTPS by blocking all S3 operations when aws:SecureTransport is false.\"}"}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens": 2746, "total_tokens": 3016, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}
